@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam ArrowColor #264653
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderColor #264653
  FontColor #1F2933
}
top to bottom direction

rectangle "UNKNOWN\nNo feedback yet\nIsActive() == false\nIsStrobeCaptured() == false" as Unknown #EAF4F4
rectangle "ACTIVE\nRuntime confirms Cockpit\nClient may gate overlays\nand capture logic here" as Active #D9EDFF
rectangle "INACTIVE\nAnother page is active\nHold page-specific logic" as Inactive #F8FAFC

Unknown --> Active : page == Cockpit
Unknown --> Inactive : page != Cockpit
Active --> Inactive : another page becomes active
Inactive --> Active : Cockpit becomes active again

note bottom of Active
While ACTIVE, strobe feedback can still
toggle the capture state of the current
dynamic reticle.
end note
@enduml
